The Magic Home protocol implementation (src/magichome/) was written for this
project. The open-source flux_led library
(https://github.com/lightinglibs/flux_led), used by the Home Assistant "Magic
Home" integration, served as the reference for the frame layouts, the model
numbers and the effect codes; no code was copied from it.

Magic Home, Zengge and Surplife are trademarks of their respective owners.
This project is not affiliated with, endorsed or supported by them. It talks
to the devices with the same local protocol as the Magic Home app, which a
firmware update may change without notice.
